### Lab15 – Mishandling of Exceptional Conditions
@host = http://localhost:8000
@token = PASTE_TOKEN

### 1. Prijava (kopiraj token u @token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "ana", "password": "Ana123!"}

### 2. Racuni korisnika
GET {{host}}/api/lab15/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. EKSPLOATACIJA (fail-open): transfer 50000 s nepoznatom valutom XYZ
# Ranjivo (main): prolazi mimo limita (iznimka u provjeri se proguta). Popravljeno: 400, saldo nepromijenjen.
POST {{host}}/api/lab15/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromAccount": "HR-ANA-001", "toAccount": "HR-MARKO-001", "amount": "50000.00", "currency": "XYZ"}

### 4. EKSPLOATACIJA (nema transakcije): transfer na nepostojeci racun
# Ranjivo (main): terecenje prode, odobrenje padne -> novac nestane; poruka otkriva detalje.
# Popravljeno: 400, saldo nepromijenjen, genericka poruka s correlationId.
POST {{host}}/api/lab15/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromAccount": "HR-ANA-001", "toAccount": "HR-NEPOSTOJI-999", "amount": "100.00", "currency": "EUR"}

### 5. Legitiman transfer 100 EUR -> 200, saldo -100
POST {{host}}/api/lab15/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromAccount": "HR-ANA-001", "toAccount": "HR-MARKO-001", "amount": "100.00", "currency": "EUR"}
